<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-6048] OOM Likely to Occur When Build Job Logs Are Too Large</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6048</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After a build task fails on a build node, the returned log information reaches approximately 600MB. When the build retry task attempts to write the task record, the excessive memory allocation required for processing the large log causes an Out-of-Memory (OOM) error, leading to service downtime.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13609041">KYLIN-6048</key>
            <summary>OOM Likely to Occur When Build Job Logs Are Too Large</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
